      "extract": "Asymptotics for Toeplitz determinants: perturbation of symbols with a gap Christophe Charlier∗and Tom Claeys∗ September 14, 2018 Abstract We study the determinants of Toeplitz matrices as the size of the matrices tends to inﬁnity, in the particular case where the symbol has two jump discontinuities and tends to zero on an arc of the unit circle at a suﬃciently fast rate. We generalize an asymptotic expansion by",
